{
  "description": "Train two candidates in parallel, gate on offline metric and shadow evaluation; failures feed back into hyperparameter tuning (two distinct retry loops).",
  "details": [
    {
      "items": [
        "Candidates share the prepared dataset; only seeds and architecture differ.",
        "Shadow traffic is 5% mirrored, never returned to the caller."
